坦福大学发布的全球Top2%科学家榜单、AI华人女性青年学者等。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aibLbWR1FgCEoiav6o07wYnUDnQmL9x2QfrZKWJcVEbTDEWMZnLImeyDOjVfO7fRqLT1xSmnpGNgibMictHgPU6ufKfTLXZ0Sc1eTRCFWpL980s/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aibLbWR1FgCF0lGxp4ANXX1icVAyFG3EduH4spVlgyG7glFrcHrQlQCPWgden646flpFW1r2HsJvJAQZbVZzwOpXoJVibJsUEj0NpEDyU2icEcs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/aibLbWR1FgCF0Hrdw4jbWR7YywyWFwiceobATXLeuxuYdhexRRnwRxMY8dTO0PB3Db86z3dcBicfODahVF2KibQ0lG4gQzJAbZzofkzR3xNBQrw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/aibLbWR1FgCFbzTySSKG4vKrlVKibLFDQmwfK9Awbp8Yf5UexchpFvRbBP8xpQ76Sj3JlheECxKcIVFiatMvM9qRiaJWhoMfRXuicfTicicLF2XzqU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><span>Part.</span><b><span>2</span></b></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>人工智能学院将于2026年7月4日-7月8日举办优秀大学生夏令营暨大模型创新训练营。本次活动以业界需求为背景、以实际项目为导向、以学生实践为主线，引导学生学习大模型相关知识，把握最新技术发展趋势，提升解决实际问题的能力。欢迎有意愿保送我院读研的优秀大学生报名参加。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>本届夏令营采用线下形式进行，学院为营员统一安排食宿。活动日程共五天，7月4日12:00-19:00报到；7月8日12:00前离营，具体安排另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><span>Part.</span><b><span>3</span></b></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.全国高校计算机科学与技术、智能科学与技术、应用数学、软件工程、自动化、信息与通信工程、物理等相关专业，将于2027年7月毕业的在校本科生；</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>2.学习成绩排名前列、能够获得所在学校的推免资格；</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>3.能够全程参加夏令营活动。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><span>Part.</span><b><span>4</span></b></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人请于</span><span><strong><span>2026年6月22日12:00前</span></strong></span><span>，登录北京师范大学夏令营申请系统(https://xly.bnu.edu.cn/xly)在线提交申请，并上传以下材料：</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1.申请表（系统填写并下载打印，签字盖章后在“其他材料”模块再次上传）；</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>2.个人自述1份（模板详见附件1）；</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>3.本科阶段成绩单和成绩排名（需加盖院系或教务部门公章）；</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>4.副教授及以上职称相关专业教师的推荐信1封（模板详见附件2）；</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>5.英语水平证明（成绩单）扫描件；</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>6.程序设计能力相关证明（如CSP成绩等）；</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>7.科研能力相关证明（如已发表的论文）；</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>8.其他证明材料（如获奖证书扫描件等）。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>以上材料1-5项为必须提交的材料，6-8项为自愿提交材料。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>其中2-3项在申请系统指定模块提交，</span><strong><span><span>并</span></span></strong><span><strong><span>将1-8项材料按顺序合成一个PDF文件</span></strong></span><span>(命名为：2026夏令营+所在学校名称+姓名+手机号)，上传至北京师范大学研究生院夏令营申请系统-上传材料-其他材料一栏。</span><span><strong><span>不需邮寄纸质材料</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>报到时请携带《北京师范大学优秀大学生夏令营活动申请表》、身份证和学生证进行资格确认，并提交身份证复印件1份及上述证明材料原件以供核对，若发现申请材料有虚假成分，即取消申请人营员资格，并保留追溯的权利。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><span>Part.</span><b><span>5</span></b></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>营员审核</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学院将组织相关专业专家对申请材料进行审核择优录取，营员名单将于6月24日左右，通过北京师范大学夏令营申请系统发布，请及时登录系统查看；营员名单也将在人工智能学院网站（https://ai.bnu.edu.cn/）和</span><strong><span>北京师范大学人工智能学院微信公众号</span></strong><span>公布，届时未入选的同学将不再另行通知。收到入营通知的同学，请于截止时间内在报名申请系统确认能否参加，逾期视为放弃资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><span>Part.</span><b><span>6</span></b></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事宜</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.人工智能学院本次夏令营不收取营员任何费用；</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>2.夏令营将统一为入选的营员提供校内食宿和在营期间意外伤害险；将安排2026年7月4日-7月7日（四晚）在北京师范大学昌平校园住宿；安排2026年7月4日-7月8日在北京师范大学昌平校园食堂用餐；</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>3.交通费用需营员自理。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><span>Part.</span><b><span>7</span></b></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联系人：刘老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：010-58804724</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：ai@bnu.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><span>Part.</span><b><span>8</span></b></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>昌平校园介绍</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>北京师范大学昌平校园学习生活配套设施完善，为学生学习生活和科研成长提供了良好环境。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>住宿生活</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/aibLbWR1FgCHLrng6n2myLicM6BC09LNp6JMWXicoz7r1NbHDxkTa8KQvEw0Kl